0.9.2-dev.1 batch notes (append; one line per change). Builder: read these before building 0.9.2-dev.1. Data: tools/pla-specs/apply_0_9_2_dev1.py over out/local-091 (0.9.1, --vanilla ../lateralus-infantry-20261110/vanilla). Build numbers: 231 = 0.9.1; use 232+.
- QN-506 / Type 86 spawn failure (Osama 19 Nov 16:3x, End's 0.9.1 log "CombatSystem initialization ... failed"): weapon positions on body hull slots. QN-506 7.62 mm 1->0 and QN-502 2->0, ZBD-86 (3 cards) 7.62 mm 1->0, ZBD-05 7.62 mm 1->0, FK-2000 SAM 2->1. check_slot_weapons.py now fails any weapon whose padded index is past the vanilla hull slot's weapon points (0.9.1 fails it with exactly these 7 mounts; the batch passes).

